mg_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/b54c3ff8a724284cabde9a99f1f1dc2d.poster.avif?t=1769379166\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/b54c3ff8a724284cabde9a99f1f1dc2d.webm?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/b54c3ff8a724284cabde9a99f1f1dc2d.mp4?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You solve my escape rooms, do a little lab work, consult on a deadly trap or two, and I'll let you leave scot-free. Doesn't that sound nice? <br><br>But before you go, let me give you some advice...  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/babe4e2332f885bbb86f7d5c8d801f23.poster.avif?t=1769379166\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/babe4e2332f885bbb86f7d5c8d801f23.webm?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/babe4e2332f885bbb86f7d5c8d801f23.mp4?t=1769379166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Don't make any mistakes.</strong><br><br><strong>Because if you do - you're <i>not</i> gonna like what happens next. </strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403570/extras/ca3f0619ac635e659c777eb58d342cca.avif?t=1769379166\" width=456 height=88 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A gripping, villainous scenario</strong> written by <strong>Mado,</strong> <i>Of The Devil's</i> <strong>Brian Mulholland, </strong>and <strong>Z.</str